# Pipeline contracts

When changing ingestion, chunk metadata, Chroma schema, RAG answers, or CLI output:

1. Check `.cursor/resources/pipeline-contract.md`
2. Preserve stable `chunk_id` format per chunk-metadata-contract
3. Keep answer JSON shape per answer-contract.md
4. Emit a handoff naming every downstream owner
5. Update corpus-inventory.md when adding source PDFs

Citation format must remain `[Document Title, p. N]` unless all writers and CLI/QA update together.
